---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: project admin cancels sale
    q_check_caller --> q_check_not_supplied: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_check_withdrawn: tokens not yet supplied
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: cannot cancel after token supply
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_cancel_simple: capitalWithdrawn == false (no capital withdrawn yet)
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_require_return: capitalWithdrawn == true (capital already withdrawn)
    q_cancel_simple --> q_mark: standard cancellation
    q_require_return --> q_verify_return: project must return full capital + fees
    q_verify_return --> q_transfer_back: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), raisedCapital)
    q_verify_return --> q_revert_return: insufficient return amount
    q_transfer_back --> q_mark: capital returned to contract
    q_mark --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled()
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_revert_return --> [*]: revert InsufficientReturn

    note right of q_require_return
        INV-001: If capital was withdrawn, project must return full amount including fees
        INV-002: Return ensures investors can be made whole on cancellation
        INV-003: Cancellation impossible after token supply
    end note
